  "description": {
   "en": "In his past life, Lin Qiu was a dreaded gangster chief. During a violent confrontation between bands, he received a deadly shot and lost knowledge. When he came back ... he was in a bed, and by his side there was a man taking off his clothes! Lin Qiu subdued him to force immediately. But the guy not only was not scared, but it cooperated quite well! Of course, Lin Qiu was using sexy lingerie. Yes ... sexy lingerie. THAT?! It was then that Lin Qiu realized that he had transmigrated to an Omegaverse world, and now he was a maintained omega, the \"pet\" of someone else ... And his alpha? Well, it wasn't exactly what I expected."
  },
